{"id":"c5ec4a3797008b26","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-halting-problem.md","title":"Halting Problem Theorem","display":"thm-halting-problem — Halting Problem Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-halting-problem","aliases":["88-thm-halting-problem"],"display":"thm-halting-problem — Halting Problem Theorem","depends_on":["[[88-df-halting-problem]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-halting-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-halting-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-halting-problem — Halting Problem Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"353b45b92236cdbb\" href=\"?note=353b45b92236cdbb\" title=\"88-df-halting-problem\">88-df-halting-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(H\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (binary halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"353b45b92236cdbb\" href=\"?note=353b45b92236cdbb\" title=\"88-df-halting-problem\">88-df-halting-problem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}(H)\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}(H)\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}(H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> : 停机问题集合 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"353b45b92236cdbb\" href=\"?note=353b45b92236cdbb\" title=\"88-df-halting-problem\">88-df-halting-problem</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> : 可判定谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li>Turing证明停机问题不可解，揭示了计算的本质局限</li>\n<li>这是可计算性理论的基石结果</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"353b45b92236cdbb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-halting-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"353b45b92236cdbb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ (binary halting set, see [[88-df-halting-problem]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}(H)$ (d